    <div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div style="max-width:64ch;">
        <p style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#D98A5E;margin-bottom:18px;">The method underneath &middot; The Flag Model&trade;</p>
        <h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,52px);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Why teams that know what to do still don&rsquo;t do it.</h2>
        <p style="margin-top:22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(244,240,231,0.78);">The Flag is the 2&ndash;3 priorities everything serves. Four disciplines hold it upright. Cut one cable and the flag tilts. Cut two and it falls. <strong style="color:#F4F0E7;">Pick the sentence that sounds like your team</strong> &mdash; and watch which cable goes.</p>
