          <a href={SLUGS.frameworksCompared} style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:#E0744A;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:15.5px;" onmouseover="this.querySelector('span').style.transform='translateX(4px)'" onmouseout="this.querySelector('span').style.transform='translateX(0)'">Compare it to EOS, OKRs &amp; 4DX <span style="transition:transform .2s;">&rarr;</span></a>
          <a href={SLUGS.research} style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:#E0744A;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:15.5px;" onmouseover="this.querySelector('span').style.transform='translateX(4px)'" onmouseout="this.querySelector('span').style.transform='translateX(0)'">See the research <span style="transition:transform .2s;">&rarr;</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bl-speakable" style="margin-top:32px;margin-bottom:8px;background:#1B1810;border:1px solid rgba(244,240,231,0.12);border-left:3px solid #C04A26;border-radius:14px;padding:24px 28px;max-width:64ch;">
        <p style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C04A26;margin-bottom:10px;">Why isn't my executive team executing?</p>
        <p style="font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(244,240,231,0.86);">Usually not strategy, talent, or effort &mdash; it's discipline. Teams know what to do and still don't do it when comfort is easier than truth. Be Legendary uses the <strong>Flag Model</strong> to locate which of four disciplines &mdash; the Decision, the Rhythm, the Standard, or the Learning &mdash; broke first, measures it with <strong>FlagScore</strong>, and rebuilds that one, instead of selling another framework.</p>
      </div>

      <FlagDiagram />

      <p style="margin-top:34px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(244,240,231,0.6);max-width:78ch;border-left:2px solid rgba(192,74,38,0.6);padding-left:18px;">
        The four disciplines are interdependent. The Decision feeds the Rhythm feeds the Standard feeds the Learning &mdash; and back into the Decision. Break the loop anywhere and it doesn't close. The governing principle underneath all four: <strong style="color:#F4F0E7;">Truth Over Comfort</strong>, paid daily or not at all.
      </p>
